stateDiagram-v2
accTitle: Tape lifecycle preserves the backup application
accDescr: The backup application writes an online virtual tape, ejects it into an archive, and retrieves it before restoration.
[*] --> Online
Online: Online virtual tape
Online --> Archiving: Backup application ejects tape
Archiving --> Archived: Upload and archival complete
Archived: Glacier-backed tape archive
Archived --> Retrieved: Retrieve tape to gateway
Retrieved --> Restored: Backup application restores files
Restored --> [*]
